Closed in the wrong order: [b]bold [i]both[/b] italic[/i].
Three at once: [b]one [i]two [u]three[/b] four[/i] five[/u].
A closing tag without an opening one: here[/i] and here[/quote].
Unknown tags keep their content: [mystery level=3]known [b]children[/b] stay[/mystery], [youtube]dQw4w9WgXcQ[/youtube].

[quote=alice]
A quote that is never closed, with [b]bold and a [url=https://example.com]link that are never closed either.

[code]A code block without an end takes the rest of the post, [b]tags[/b] and all.
